# Which files of this repository Cloudflare publishes as the site. Everything
# at the root is left out, then the site is let back in by name - so a new file
# at the root stays private until it is added here, rather than going public
# the day it is created. _headers stays out: Cloudflare reads it either way,
# and let in it would also be served.
/*
!/index.html
!/favicon.ico
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/assets/
!/css/
!/js/
